# Q#: Q# language reference (Microsoft Quantum); requirements/languages/qsharp.md
name     qsharp qs
keyword  namespace open operation function let mutable set use borrow if elif else for in while repeat
keyword  until fixup return within apply is Adj Ctl body adjoint controlled newtype import
type     Qubit Result Int Double Bool String Unit BigInt Range Pauli
builtin  true false Zero One PauliX PauliZ H X CNOT M Reset Message
line-comment   //
string   " "  : escapes
prefix   $    : interp=braces
sigil    @    : meta
operators  +-*/%&|^!<>=:?~.
calls
